IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ita-types`
IMPORT `ita-rates`
IMPORT `ita-reliefs`
IMPORT `cpf-contributions`
IMPORT `cpf-wages-year`
IMPORT `sg-household`

-- SUPPLEMENTARY cases S1 to S8: NOT among the 70 frozen cases of independent-expectations.md.
-- They were written AFTER the encoding's input types and the test file's fixture layout had been read.
-- S1 restates case 51 in the one-share-per-child inputs the module had when it was written (the module now has two shares, and case 51 itself is in tests-independent.l4); S2 to S6 and S8 probe things the 70 did not;
-- S7: a foreign employee (the expectation first written from the BRIEF's scope sentence, "not covered", and changed to the Exemption Order's reading; see the case).
-- Expected numbers: S1 to S6 computed by the unchanged model.py of the frozen expectations; S7 has none; S8 worked by hand (see the report).

§ `Independent fixtures`

`a month of pay` ow aw MEANS `My pay in one month` OF ow, aw

GIVEN h IS A `Household`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`tax of` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the household's position` h
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0 MINUS 1
    WHEN JUST p THEN p's `income tax of the household`

GIVEN h IS A `Household`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`CPF of` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the household's position` h
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0 MINUS 1
    WHEN JUST p THEN p's `employee CPF of the household`

GIVEN h IS A `Household`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`net of` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the household's position` h
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0 MINUS 1
    WHEN JUST p THEN p's `net income of the household`

GIVEN h IS A `Household`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`first adult carry of` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the household's position` h
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0 MINUS 1
    WHEN JUST p THEN (p's `the first adult's position`)'s `parenthood rebate carried forward`

GIVEN h IS A `Household`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`second adult carry of` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the household's position` h
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0 MINUS 1
    WHEN JUST p THEN
        CONSIDER p's `the second adult's position`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN 0 MINUS 1
        WHEN JUST q THEN q's `parenthood rebate carried forward`

GIVEN h IS A `Household`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `not covered` IF
    CONSIDER `the household's position` h
    WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
    WHEN JUST p THEN FALSE

